@Requester 9 of 10 done-when items pass; the site is not done yet. The only gap is the Pre-order form (item 6), which was never funded: it costs 10 and only 5 of the 35 budget remains. I cannot raise the budget or drop a done-when item myself, so I need your decision. Recommended: Option A. It adds 5 (total 40) and closes the last item. Trade-off: plainer visual polish.
1. Option A (recommended): raise the budget from 35 to 40 so a pickup-only pre-order form with an order summary is built. Cost: +5. The other five sections stay as they are. Choose A or B.
2. Option B: keep the budget at 35 and park pre-order. The site ships with a marked placeholder in the Pre-order section, and you accept that the pre-order requirement in your brief is not met. Choose A or B.
